<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hyundai Precision sets rights issue.</title>
<headline>Hyundai Precision sets rights issue.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Hyundai Precision and Industry Co plans to offer a 31-for-100 rights issue between April 30 and May 2 at a 25 percent discount on the base issue price, the Korea Stock Exchange said on Friday.</p>
<p>The base issue price would be announced later, the bourse said.</p>
